msgid ""
"⚠ This is %1, which writes changes to new blocks instead of over the old "
"ones, and snapshots keep whole copies. The file will be gone, but its "
"contents may still be recoverable from the disk. Full-disk encryption is "
"what actually prevents that."
msgstr ""
"⚠ Ceci est %1, qui écrit les modifications dans de nouveaux blocs au lieu "
"d'écraser les anciens, et les instantanés conservent des copies entières. Le "
"fichier disparaîtra, mais son contenu restera peut-être récupérable sur le "
"disque. Seul le chiffrement intégral du disque l'empêche vraiment."

msgid ""
"⚠ This is %1, which writes changes to new blocks instead of over the old "
"ones. The file will be gone, but its contents may still be recoverable from "
"the disk. Full-disk encryption is what actually prevents that."
